MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Separate Room database aligram-preservation v1 (PreservedRef /
PreservedBlob / DeferredDelete; no cache4.db or ayu-data change).
AliGramEligibility: pure JVM-testable policy (strict date > activation,
PENDING/STAMPED incl. R-7, P/E/X matrix, v1 media caps, deferred-delete
release rules). AliGramFileCopy: the only file-moving code on the path
(temp + fsync + size/SHA verify + atomic rename; never move/rename a
source). AliGramPreservation: H-I ingest, H-C fan-out claim + R-19
watchdog/probe, state-based deferred delete, Stage-A pin, LIVE-sync
(2.3 §4.1), Phase-B fakeId+revisionSeq bind, H-D bind + ANCHOR_LOST,
startup reconcile, UI-safe render cache, per-account purge.
EditedMessageDao.insert now returns long (fakeId bind); additive
existsByFakeId queries on both Ayu DAOs.
